### =====================================================================
### Pruebas manuales por requerimiento
###
### Antes de empezar:
###  - Reiniciá la API: todo vive en memoria, así que cada arranque parte de cero.
###  - Pedidos semilla (OrderSeedData):
###      2500000006-01 -> cliente 01021755 (Tiendas Peruanas, formato propio)
###      2500000007-01 -> cliente 01021755
###      2500000008-01 -> cliente 01021800 (formato por defecto)
###      2500000009-01 -> cliente 01021900 (formato por defecto)
###  - La clave de idempotencia es pedido + serviceType + status + subStatus + eventDate.
###    Por eso cada request usa una eventDate distinta: si la repetís, se ignora como duplicado.
###  - El procesamiento es asíncrono (Outbox con tick de 500 ms): esperá ~1 s antes de consultar el historial.
###  - Notificaciones, evidencias y DLQ solo se verifican en los logs de la consola.
### =====================================================================

@host = http://localhost:5020
@apiKey = <your-tms-webhook-api-key>


### =====================================================================
### REQ 1 — Recepción y validación del webhook
### =====================================================================

### 1.1 Sin API key -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/tms/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceType": "PICKUP",
  "status": "PLANNING",
  "details": { "orderNumber": "2500000006-01" },
  "eventDate": "2025-04-10 08:00:00"
}

### 1.2 API key incorrecta -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/tms/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: clave-incorrecta

{
  "serviceType": "PICKUP",
  "status": "PLANNING",
  "details": { "orderNumber": "2500000006-01" },
  "eventDate": "2025-04-10 08:00:00"
}

### 1.3 Status desconocido -> 400 "Unknown status"
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/tms/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "serviceType": "LAST_MILE",
  "status": "LOST",
  "details": { "orderNumber": "2500000006-01" },
  "eventDate": "2025-04-10 08:00:00"
}

### 1.4 serviceType y dispatchType desconocidos -> 400 con dos errores
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/tms/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "serviceType": "EXPRESS",
  "dispatchType": "DRONE",
  "status": "PLANNING",
  "details": { "orderNumber": "2500000006-01" },
  "eventDate": "2025-04-10 08:00:00"
}

### 1.5 Fecha en ISO 8601 en vez del formato del TMS -> 400 "eventDate must use the format"
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/tms/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "serviceType": "PICKUP",
  "status": "PLANNING",
  "details": { "orderNumber": "2500000006-01" },
  "eventDate": "2025-04-10T08:00:00Z"
}

### 1.6 Sin details.orderNumber -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/tms/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "serviceType": "PICKUP",
  "status": "PLANNING",
  "details": { "clientCode": "01021755" },
  "eventDate": "2025-04-10 08:00:00"
}

### 1.7 Pedido que no existe en el OMS -> 202 (se acepta)
### Esperado en logs: "Order 9999999999-01 not found in OMS, ... event ignored"
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/tms/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "serviceType": "PICKUP",
  "status": "PLANNING",
  "details": { "orderNumber": "9999999999-01" },
  "eventDate": "2025-04-10 08:00:00"
}

### 1.8 Historial de un pedido inexistente -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/orders/9999999999-01/history


### =====================================================================
### REQ 2, 5, 6 y 7 — Ciclo feliz completo (pedido 2500000006-01, Tiendas Peruanas)
### Recorre los estados de recojo y de entrega.
### =====================================================================

### 2.1 PLANNING (recojo) — status en minúsculas: el mapeo no distingue mayúsculas
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/tms/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "serviceType": "PICKUP",
  "dispatchType": "HOME_DELIVERY",
  "status": "planning",
  "subStatus": "ASSIGNED",
  "vehicleCode": "LIMURB06VAN",
  "courierName": "Conductor 46",
  "details": {
    "orderNumber": "2500000006-01",
    "trackingNumber": "OE2500000006-01",
    "clientCode": "01021755",
    "clientName": "TIENDAS PERUANAS S.A."
  },
  "eventDate": "2025-04-15 08:00:00"
}

### 2.2 STARTED
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/tms/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "serviceType": "PICKUP",
  "dispatchType": "HOME_DELIVERY",
  "status": "STARTED",
  "vehicleCode": "LIMURB06VAN",
  "courierName": "Conductor 46",
  "details": { "orderNumber": "2500000006-01", "trackingNumber": "OE2500000006-01", "clientCode": "01021755" },
  "eventDate": "2025-04-15 09:00:00"
}

### 2.3 AT PICKUP POINT (status con espacios)
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/tms/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "serviceType": "PICKUP",
  "dispatchType": "HOME_DELIVERY",
  "status": "AT PICKUP POINT",
  "vehicleCode": "LIMURB06VAN",
  "courierName": "Conductor 46",
  "details": { "orderNumber": "2500000006-01", "trackingNumber": "OE2500000006-01", "clientCode": "01021755" },
  "eventDate": "2025-04-15 09:30:00"
}

### 2.4 COLLECTED con evidencia -> hito: se descarga y se guarda
### Esperado en logs: "Evidence collected_001.jpg stored at memory://evidences/orders/2500000006-01/collected_001.jpg"
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/tms/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "serviceType": "PICKUP",
  "dispatchType": "HOME_DELIVERY",
  "status": "COLLECTED",
  "subStatus": "VALIDATED",
  "vehicleCode": "LIMURB06VAN",
  "courierName": "Conductor 46",
  "details": {
    "orderNumber": "2500000006-01",
    "trackingNumber": "OE2500000006-01",
    "clientCode": "01021755",
    "evidences": [
      { "label": "Paquete", "fileType": ".jpg", "fileName": "collected_001.jpg", "url": "https://httpbin.org/image/jpeg" }
    ]
  },
  "eventDate": "2025-04-15 10:00:00"
}

### 2.5 PLANNING de última milla CON evidencia -> NO es hito: no se descarga nada
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/tms/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "serviceType": "LAST_MILE",
  "dispatchType": "HOME_DELIVERY",
  "status": "PLANNING",
  "vehicleCode": "LIMURB06VAN",
  "courierName": "Conductor 46",
  "details": {
    "orderNumber": "2500000006-01",
    "trackingNumber": "OE2500000006-01",
    "clientCode": "01021755",
    "evidences": [
      { "label": "No debería guardarse", "fileType": ".jpg", "fileName": "planning.jpg", "url": "https://httpbin.org/image/jpeg" }
    ]
  },
  "eventDate": "2025-04-15 14:00:00"
}

### 2.6 DELIVERED con 3 evidencias: una válida, una con path traversal y una con URL mal escrita
### Esperado en logs:
###  - "delivered_201054.jpg stored at .../orders/2500000006-01/delivered_201054.jpg"
###  - "secrets.png stored at .../orders/2500000006-01/secrets.png" (el "../../" se descarta)
###  - "Invalid evidence URL 'htps://...' ... evidence skipped"
###  - Push a 01021755 con formato Tiendas Peruanas: "estado":"ENTREGADO","intentos":1,"recibidoPor":"Pepito Perez"
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/tms/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "serviceType": "LAST_MILE",
  "dispatchType": "HOME_DELIVERY",
  "status": "DELIVERED",
  "subStatus": "CLIENT RECEIVED",
  "vehicleCode": "LIMURB06VAN",
  "courierName": "Conductor 46",
  "details": {
    "orderNumber": "2500000006-01",
    "trackingNumber": "OE2500000006-01",
    "clientCode": "01021755",
    "clientName": "TIENDAS PERUANAS S.A.",
    "receivedBy": "Pepito Perez",
    "comments": "Entregado en domicilio",
    "evidences": [
      { "label": "Paquete", "fileType": ".jpg", "fileName": "delivered_201054.jpg", "url": "https://httpbin.org/image/jpeg" },
      { "label": "Firma", "fileType": ".png", "fileName": "../../secrets.png", "url": "https://httpbin.org/image/png" },
      { "label": "Fachada", "fileType": ".jpg", "fileName": "delivered_201055.jpg", "url": "htps://beetrack.com/img/delivered_201055.jpg" }
    ]
  },
  "eventDate": "2025-04-15 16:53:07"
}

### 2.7 Idempotencia: el MISMO DELIVERED otra vez -> 202
### Esperado en logs: "Duplicate DELIVERED event ignored". El historial NO suma otra entrada.
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/tms/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "serviceType": "LAST_MILE",
  "dispatchType": "HOME_DELIVERY",
  "status": "DELIVERED",
  "subStatus": "CLIENT RECEIVED",
  "vehicleCode": "LIMURB06VAN",
  "courierName": "Conductor 46",
  "details": {
    "orderNumber": "2500000006-01",
    "trackingNumber": "OE2500000006-01",
    "clientCode": "01021755",
    "receivedBy": "Pepito Perez"
  },
  "eventDate": "2025-04-15 16:53:07"
}

### 2.8 REQ 2 — Estado final: NOT DELIVERED después de DELIVERED -> se rechaza
### Esperado: historial con outcome Rejected y rejectionReason FinalState.
### NO se notifica al cliente y NO se guarda la evidencia (el evento no se aplicó).
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/tms/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "serviceType": "LAST_MILE",
  "dispatchType": "HOME_DELIVERY",
  "status": "NOT DELIVERED",
  "subStatus": "CLIENT ABSENT",
  "vehicleCode": "LIMURB06VAN",
  "courierName": "Conductor 46",
  "details": {
    "orderNumber": "2500000006-01",
    "trackingNumber": "OE2500000006-01",
    "clientCode": "01021755",
    "evidences": [
      { "label": "Fachada", "fileType": ".jpg", "fileName": "rejected.jpg", "url": "https://httpbin.org/image/jpeg" }
    ]
  },
  "eventDate": "2025-04-16 10:00:00"
}

### 2.9 REQ 5 — Historial: 6 entradas aplicadas + 1 rechazada, sin el duplicado
GET {{host}}/api/orders/2500000006-01/history


